rule same_rule_date_on_its_day v1
description "A date a table of the same rule writes, absent for an order picked up at the shop, named under `policy first`: the absent value, the first day, then the rest"

enum zone = local | national | pickup
enum timing = early | late | collected

inputs
  zone : zone

outputs
  x : timing

table ships_of
| zone     | -> ships : date? |
| local    | 2026-07-01       |
| national | 2026-07-03       |
| pickup   | none             |

table pick
policy first
| ships      | -> x      |
| none       | collected |
| 2026-07-01 | early     |
| -          | late      |
